	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "84ffac57-2587-4440-a4ea-4cab63df98b0",
		"name": "Portage CyberTech - OAuth2 End-to-End",
		"description": "HTTP contract checks for both Spring Boot services. Select Env Dev, Env Int, or Env Prod before running the collection; all three profiles target localhost and do not represent deployed environments. Protected requests use an OAuth 2.0 Bearer access token issued by the collection flow. The subject grant is a localhost demo mechanism only; it does not authenticate the supplied subject. In Postman Desktop, the collection OAuth 2.0 settings are configured. Protected requests also read the environment token so they can run reproducibly with Postman CLI or Newman.",
